    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in the heart of the vibrant seaside resort of Ballybunion, this truly charming and fully refurbished 3-bedroom home offers pristine, turn-key accommodation. Superbly presented throughout, this beautiful property combines modern comfort with coastal elegance, making an immediate viewing highly advised to fully appreciate its exceptional quality.\r\n\r\nLight filled interior and modern amenities. \r\nTurn-key finish: Meticulously upgraded with high-quality, contemporary finishes.\r\nPristine presentation: Walk-in condition with neutral stylish decor.\r\n\r\nLocation & Appeal\r\nThe property is positioned within immediate proximity of all of Ballybunion’s local amenities, including its world-famous beaches, championship golf courses, schools, and vibrant eateries. This versatile home holds immense appeal for a wide selection of discerning buyers, from first-time homeowners and retirees to those seeking a premium holiday retreat.\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing of this coastal gem."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.2m x 6.3m \r\nWith an anthracite and cream chequered tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 3.6m x 3.6m \r\nWith laminate engineered timber flooring and insert Pierse solid fuel stove.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 3.2m \r\nWith laminate engineered timber flooring and decorative cast-iron open fireplace with tiled insert.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.4m x 3.6m \r\nWith engineered laminate timber flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.6m x 3.2m \r\nWith engineered laminate timber flooring.\r\n\r\nShower Room - 1.7m x 2.3m \r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling complete with toilet, sink with fitted vanity unit and large shower tray with electric Triton shower.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.8m x 3.0m \r\nWith tiled timber effect flooring, sliding entrance door and solid fuel Henley stove on a polished granite heart, \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 3.7m x 3.6m \r\nWith tiled timber affect flooring, solid oak fitted kitchen with gas hob, extractor fan, double oven, microwave and fridge freezer. Plumbed for washing machine, dishwasher and stainless steel sink with mixer tap - doorway to rear yard.\r\n\r\nLean-to Lock-up Store - 4.3m x 2.6m \r\n\r\n\r\nLean-to Lock-up Store - 11.0m x 2.9m \r\nWith potential for a variety of uses - set out in two rooms with shower room, toilet and wash and basin.\r\n\r\nFuel Store - 2.4m x 2.0m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large enclosed south facing rear garden with concrete yard offering off-street parking and manicure lawn.\r\nSecure block built boundary walls with gated vehicle access from the main street.\r\nFully refurbished home with PVC/windows and pitched slate roof.\r\nElectric storage heating with wall mounted aluminium radiators.\r\nConnected to all public mains services.\r\nEfficient electric heating system installed throughout.\r\nSuperb outdoor space and parking.\r\nVehicle Access: Secure, gated vehicle access to the rear.\r\nAmple Parking: Generous car parking available to both the front and rear.\r\nSouth facing aspect: Sun-drenched rear garden and yard, ideal for outdoor entertaining.\r\nExtensive storage: Large private site featuring a variety of useful outbuildings and a chalet."
      },
      {
